at most 5 guests besides bride and groom. Are there any hotels that offer complimentary small ceremonies? Our good friend will be the officiant, so all I realLy need is a nice place on the beach and some cake\/wine for afterwards. &amp;nbsp;I have looked at many wedding packages, and they are in the 2,000 plus range which is totally out of my budget and they are for larger parties. All suggestions are appreciated as I have never been to Cabo.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898043,"PostDate":1433690796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am trying to plan a very small destination wedding with at most 5 guests besides bride and groom. Are there any hotels that offer complimentary small ceremonies? Our good friend will be the officiant, so all I realLy need is a nice place on the beach and some cake\/wine for afterwards. \u00a0I have looked at many wedding packages, and they are in the 2,000 plus range which is totally out of my budget and they are for larger parties. All suggestions are appreciated as I have never been to Cabo.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiecollette@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.121.164.248","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433690458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283423.jpg?_r=1434627794","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"jackiecollette","Id":283423,"Name":"jackiecollette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.119.165.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ff8b3bad044e571075533cba98d28dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Secrets Resorts does have a complimentary wedding package that sounds like it might be what you&#039;re looking for.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.secretsresorts.com\/puerto-los-cabos\/weddings&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.secretsresorts.com\/puerto-los-cabos\/weddings&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898050,"PostDate":1433722206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Secrets Resorts does have a complimentary wedding package that sounds like it might be what you're looking for.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.secretsresorts.com\/puerto-los-cabos\/weddings' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.secretsre...-cabos\/weddings<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415121095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.133.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecf51921b8dfe8c9fb551ba74c70865e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think any of the AM resorts would be a good fit for you (they include Dreams, Secrets, Now resorts). They offer a complementary wedding package if you have a certain number of rooms booked for 3 nights.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898098,"PostDate":1433788962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think any of the AM resorts would be a good fit for you (they include Dreams, Secrets, Now resorts). They offer a complementary wedding package if you have a certain number of rooms booked for 3 nights.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79255","Title":"Small Destination Wedding In Cabo","LastPostDate":14337