{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2045,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1656298,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":259288,"Name":"GingaNinja","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259288.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1345814790,"LastPoster":{"Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":5,"Preview":{"Id":1853611,"PostDate":1401823541,"PostContent":"Hi there! I was heavily researching Huatulco because it looked amazing, the price was right, and...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikkicraig10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395779138,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nikkicraig10","Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f59f56a877912282dc746f3f71b07598","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; New to the site.&amp;nbsp; Thinking about having destination wedding in Playa Del Carmen since information is so easy to find.&amp;nbsp; Our first though was Huatulco, since it&#039;s different\/less main stream, but I&#039;m having SUCH a hard time finding any info.&amp;nbsp; So far all I have come up with are the resorts (and I would prefer not to get married at a resort) and private estates.&amp;nbsp; The folks from Las Brisas says that it&#039;s quite private - but I&#039;m skeptical.&amp;nbsp; And the idea of paying $99 a head for reception dinner that is probably exactly what everyone else on the resort is eating absolutely kills me.&amp;nbsp; The private estate we found was nice, but out of the way.&amp;nbsp; Transporting 75 people is getting on my nerves, mostly because I can&#039;t find any information on transportation around there.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, is there much to do and see around there.&amp;nbsp; I am not the kind of person that lies on the beach all day.&amp;nbsp; I like to go out, do stuff, and see stuff.&amp;nbsp; Is Huatulco too low key for me?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any thoughts\/suggestions are appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1656298,"PostDate":1345814790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi,<\/p> <p> New to the site.\u00a0 Thinking about having destination wedding in Playa Del Carmen since information is so easy to find.\u00a0 Our first though was Huatulco, since it's different\/less main stream, but I'm having SUCH a hard time finding any info.\u00a0 So far all I have come up with are the resorts (and I would prefer not to get married at a resort) and private estates.\u00a0 The folks from Las Brisas says that it's quite private - but I'm skeptical.\u00a0 And the idea of paying $99 a head for reception dinner that is probably exactly what everyone else on the resort is eating absolutely kills me.\u00a0 The private estate we found was nice, but out of the way.\u00a0 Transporting 75 people is getting on my nerves, mostly because I can't find any information on transportation around there.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, is there much to do and see around there.\u00a0 I am not the kind of person that lies on the beach all day.\u00a0 I like to go out, do stuff, and see stuff.\u00a0 Is Huatulco too low key for me?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any thoughts\/suggestions are appreciated!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lucid.anne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345229206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259288.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingaNinja","Id":259288,"Name":"GingaNinja","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8f094f5f2548dc88ac25fbdd062adfb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sorry for ranting btw!&amp;nbsp; Just frustrating.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1656299,"PostDate":1345814835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sorry for ranting btw!\u00a0 Just frustrating.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lucid.anne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345229206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259288.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingaNinja","Id":259288,"Name":"GingaNinja","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fc49521ce6fca9adbab1dcb3e190a32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Check out what surrounds Huatulco at my Playa Zipolite Blog here: &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/playazipolite.blogspot.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/playazipolite.blogspot.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ivan&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1656987,"PostDate":1346039951,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Check out what surrounds Huatulco at my Playa Zipolite Blog here: \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/playazipolite.blogspot.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/playazipolite.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ivan<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ivanjay99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346039722,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ivanjay99","Id":259657,"Name":"ivanjay99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1aed3e98bdec191626a59139c0db7141","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been spending a month (February) every year for the past 17 years in Huatulco. &amp;nbsp; This year we&#039;ll be there in November and again in February. &amp;nbsp; Its a little bit of paradise. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Spectacular weather, 36 beaches (many of them completely undeveloped and often empty), great restaurants, hotels, villas &amp;amp; condos. &amp;nbsp; Lots of folks get married there. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;I suggest you contact Palm Princess. &amp;nbsp; Let them know your plans &amp;amp; preferences.. &amp;nbsp;Either Valerie or Ariana should be able to help. http:\/\/www.palmprincessmexico.com\/Content\/default.asp   &amp;nbsp; Did I say Huatulco is also extremely safe?   &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Mike&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657186,"PostDate":1346093732,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idahojones@cableone.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346093454,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259668.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Idahojones","Id":259668,"Name":"Idahojones","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16fb1d1b3addc75d8d43ee2a086ab249","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hola GingaNinja! I recently shot a wedding at Dreams Huatulco, and it was beyond awesome:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/samuellunablog.com\/weddings\/juliane-curtis-dreams-huatulco-mexico-destination-wedding-photographer-samuel-luna\/\n \n Huatulco is very small and there&#039;s not much nightlife going on, but there&#039;s a special charm to it, traditional and quaint.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657298,"PostDate":1346108647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hola GingaNinja! I recently shot a wedding at Dreams Huatulco, and it was beyond awesome:<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/samuellunablog.com\/weddings\/juliane-curtis-dreams-huatulco-mexico-destination-wedding-photographer-samuel-luna\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/samuellunablo...er-samuel-luna\/<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Huatulco is very small and there's not much nightlife going on, but there's a special charm to it, traditional and quaint.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"s@samuelluna.com","IpAddress":"187.153.140.144","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1337617778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255626.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":191,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Samuel Luna","Id":255626,"Name":"Samuel Luna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e4362b9047790cb5d88a5b3b04f43d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; GingaNinja! I love that name =)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; First off, let me say that you are on the right track when you are thinking Huatulco for your destination wedding. As Samuel mentioned above, the place is beautiful. (His photo shoot is stellar by the way - definitely check it out).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am very familiar with Huatulco and can help you find all the answers you need. I would start with familiarizing yourself with the area ad what kinds of activities you can partake in. A short list includes, cooking classes, surfing, snorkeling, zip lining, yoga, tours of the coffee plantation and National Park and so much more.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have written about all the things you can do on our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/blog.myhuatulcovacation.com\/\"&gt;Huatulco Vacation Blog&lt;\/a&gt;. Start poking around there and see what peaks your interest.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n Next I would take a look at the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.myhuatulcovacation.com\/\"&gt;Huatulco Rental Villas&lt;\/a&gt; available. More often than not you can stay for much cheaper than at the local resorts. There are also options to hire personal chefs to prepare authentic meals for you and your friends\/family.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you have any specific questions, please feel free to ask them here or contact Judy [at] myhuatulcovacation.com and she can handle bookings, tours and special requests for your entire party.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I do hope you choose Huatulco for your wedding but I wish you a magical day wherever you ultimately decide on.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657420,"PostDate":1346163649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> GingaNinja! I love that name =)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> First off, let me say that you are on the right track when you are thinking Huatulco for your destination wedding. As Samuel mentioned above, the place is beautiful. (His photo shoot is stellar by the way - definitely check it out).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am very familiar with Huatulco and can help you find all the answers you need. I would start with familiarizing yourself with the area ad what kinds of activities you can partake in. A short list includes, cooking classes, surfing, snorkeling, zip lining, yoga, tours of the coffee plantation and National Park and so much more.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have written about all the things you can do on our <a href='http:\/\/blog.myhuatulcovacation.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Huatulco Vacation Blog<\/a>. Start poking around there and see what peaks your interest.<\/p> <p> <br \/> Next I would take a look at the <a href='http:\/\/www.myhuatulcovacation.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Huatulco Rental Villas<\/a> available. More often than not you can stay for much cheaper than at the local resorts. There are also options to hire personal chefs to prepare authentic meals for you and your friends\/family.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you have any specific questions, please feel free to ask them here or contact Judy [at] myhuatulcovacation.com and she can handle bookings, tours and special requests for your entire party.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I do hope you choose Huatulco for your wedding but I wish you a magical day wherever you ultimately decide on.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valerie@myhuatulcovacation.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346162875,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259706.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":95,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Joe Huatulco","Id":259706,"Name":"Joe Huatulco","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69176,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9950e8aefae4381127672bae5bf91c73","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there! I was heavily researching Huatulco because it looked amazing, the price was right, and it was \"different\" then where most DW&#039;s take place. The 2 properties I looked at were Dreams Huatulco and Secrets Huatulco. Both offered a pretty luxurious property, and seemed to be on very private stretches of beach. Reviews said Huatulco is a more \"mexican\" feel than other destinations such as Cabo and Cancun, and had much nicer water and beaches than PV. It hardly rains, the water was swimmable and the wedding packages at these 2 resorts were favourable.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I chose against Huatulco for one main reason - It is extremely hot. Because we are getting married in May, it would just be way, way too hot. I knew of a wedding that went at the end of March, and the sunburns I heard about..... I read a review saying that Nov-Feb are really the best months to go to avoid this, so if you&#039;re planning around that time, then great!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853611,"PostDate":1401823541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there! I was heavily researching Huatulco because it looked amazing, the price was right, and it was \"different\" then where most DW's take place. The 2 properties I looked at were Dreams Huatulco and Secrets Huatulco. Both offered a pretty luxurious property, and seemed to be on very private stretches of beach. Reviews said Huatulco is a more \"mexican\" feel than other destinations such as Cabo and Cancun, and had much nicer water and beaches than PV. It hardly rains, the water was swimmable and the wedding packages at these 2 resorts were favourable.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I chose against Huatulco for one main reason - It is extremely hot. Because we are getting married in May, it would just be way, way too hot. I knew of a wedding that went at the end of March, and the sunburns I heard about..... I read a review saying that Nov-Feb are really the best months to go to avoid this, so if you're planning around that time, then great!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikkicraig10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395779138,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nikkicraig10","Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"69176","Title":"Anyone been to Huatulco?","LastPostDate":1401823541},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
