 in the research stages of trying to narrow down my resort, and boyyy is it more difficult than expected! Hope to get lots of feedback and help from you guy, and hopefully we can all be of assistance through this entire process!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895559,"PostDate":1430944153,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Ladies-<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am still in the research stages of trying to narrow down my resort, and boyyy is it more difficult than expected! Hope to get lots of feedback and help from you guy, and hopefully we can all be of assistance through this entire process!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"knjones01@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.40.82.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430879669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"knjones01","Id":282990,"Name":"knjones01","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79156,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03cfe6ab19fe655f1cd305be17b9784e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Picking your resort is honestly the hardest part. I am getting married in Jamaica, however I will be attending a destination wedding this November in Punta Cana.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895624,"PostDate":1431010169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Picking your resort is honestly the hardest part. I am getting married in Jamaica, however I will be attending a destination wedding this November in Punta Cana.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79156,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"177e1fb3b96095b59ba5d015a80046ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, knjones01!!! it&#039;s a great place to find lots of helpful info regarding planning decisions, so well done on being off to a wonderful start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration along the way, here are a few magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera recently......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt; RUI Palace Pennisula Cancun Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11206474_10153270894719487_4622723487578905992_o.jpg\" alt=\"11206474_10153270894719487_4622723487578\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11206494_10153270895734487_2271906888341572773_o.jpg\" alt=\"11206494_10153270895734487_2271906888341\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11114282_10153270897064487_4715240686254097208_o.jpg\" alt=\"11114282_10153270897064487_4715240686254\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you the perfectly wonderful wedding celebration of your dreams - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895639,"PostDate":1431012341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, knjones01!!! it's a great place to find lots of helpful info regarding planning decisions, so well done on being off to a wonderful start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration along the way, here are a few magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera recently......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153270894224487.1073741928.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> RUI Palace Pennisula Cancun Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11206474_10153270894719487_4622723487578905992_o.jpg\" alt=\"11206474_10153270894719487_4622723487578\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11206494_10153270895734487_2271906888341572773_o.jpg\" alt=\"11206494_10153270895734487_2271906888341\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11114282_10153270897064487_4715240686254097208_o.jpg\" alt=\"11114282_10153270897064487_4715240686254\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you the perfectly wonderful wedding celebration of your dreams - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.143.75.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79156,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfa49de24ce358834ed1c522a980a418","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi I&#039;m getting married 06-25-2015 at Paradisus Palma Real&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895890,"PostDate":1431315249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi I'm getting married 06-25-2015 at Paradisus Palma Real<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrfatta2012@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.143.75.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431313416,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nicole2016","Id":283053,"Name":"Nicole2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.69.248.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79156,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25e102a2390eb9b4d4c4cb2f1a20bb05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Nicole2016\"] congrats on your destination wedding! we have finally set a date and it will be at Majestic Colonial on April 2, 2016! Im so excited, I&#039;m sure you are too!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lisa35\"] Congrats and thanks for responding to my posts. I have finally decided on my resort location. &amp;nbsp;Where are is the destination wedding you are attending in DR? i would love to hear about it! i looked into Jamaica also- but everywhere i liked was wayyy more expensive than i was expecting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899322,"PostDate":1435264316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283053\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283053-nicole2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Nicole2016<\/span><\/a> congrats on your destination wedding! we have finally set a date and it will be at Majestic Colonial on April 2, 2016! Im so excited, I'm sure you are too!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282406\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282406-lisa35\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lisa35<\/span><\/a> Congrats and thanks for responding to my posts. I have finally decided on my resort location. \u00a0Where are is the destination wedding you are attending in DR? i would love to hear about it! i looked into Jamaica also- but everywhere i liked was wayyy more expensive than i was expecting.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"knjones01@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.40.82.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430879669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"knjones01","Id":282990,"Name":"knjones01","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79156,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2a234756bef351d883eb5675535e084","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The wedding in Punta Cana that we are attending is at the RUI. Jamaica is more expensive but its the easiest place to have a legal ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899363,"PostDate":1435324470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The wedding in Punta Cana that we are attending is at the RUI. Jamaica is more expensive but its the easiest place to have a legal ceremony.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79156","Title":"2016 Bride Here! Looking To Get Married In Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1435324470},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
