  'SessionId' => '6bf98a665dd1f13a299d0dacb07dbcc8',
  'forumId' => '14',
  'title' => 'Invitations!',
  'postContent' => 'Hi all, new to the forum but looking for a little help from other women who are going through this process too! We are planning our wedding in 6/16 in Punta Cana and I\'m really stuck on invitations. We are booking through a travel agency and having our guests do the same, so we will be getting a wedding website through the agency. Do I need to send out save the dates and formal invitations when they really only need the date and the website?? In my head I think I can get away with a save the date type invitation with our website on it and since everyone will be booking far in advance the traditional invitation being sent out 8-10 weeks before the wedding seems useless to me. What has everyone else done?! Thanks!!!',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '6bf98a665dd1f13a299d0dacb07dbcc8',
)
