Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":10,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1899499,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283746,"Name":"shelbylayne4","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283746.jpg?_r=1435605976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1435606243,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1899499,"PostDate":1435606243,"PostContent":"Hi! \u00a0 I am set on getting hitched in Cabo San Lucas in March 2016! I know I want to stay at a hot...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelbylayne4@ymail.com","IpAddress":"216.110.25.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435605274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283746.jpg?_r=1435605976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shelbylayne4","Id":283746,"Name":"shelbylayne4","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.110.25.2","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79329,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a194432817bf2423b558cca2139af97","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am set on getting hitched in Cabo San Lucas in March 2016! I know I want to stay at a hotel that offers all-inclusive because of my guests coming. I want something that is affordable, yet a beautiful resort! I am not looking to have my wedding at the hotel, I want a low key, quick, and intimate ceremony on the beach with all of my friends and family standing by! So any hotel ideas would be super helpful. Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899499,"PostDate":1435606243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am set on getting hitched in Cabo San Lucas in March 2016! I know I want to stay at a hotel that offers all-inclusive because of my guests coming. I want something that is affordable, yet a beautiful resort! I am not looking to have my wedding at the hotel, I want a low key, quick, and intimate ceremony on the beach with all of my friends and family standing by! So any hotel ideas would be super helpful. Thank you!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelbylayne4@ymail.com","IpAddress":"216.110.25.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435605274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283746.jpg?_r=1435605976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shelbylayne4","Id":283746,"Name":"shelbylayne4","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.161.70.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79329,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98c195b37df3e78a43b5e046fc092b83","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"shelbylayne4\"] and welcome to BDW! Oh my goodness - you have to talk tho the administrators of this site Wright Travel! They are destination wedding experts and the host is a Dreams Cabo bride herself!! Cabo has some beautiful hotels so I know they wouldbe able to help iOS out with what you want and what you don&#039;t want, along with your budget and price point for your guests. You can contact them though this site - just look for the link. We&#039;ve looked at the Riu Santa Fe, plus as I said Tammy is a Dreams Cabo bride. There are a lot of west coast brides here that get married in the Cabo area. You could also look at the resort review tab on this site and see what past brides have had to say about their experience.\n\n\nGood luck and happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1899509,"PostDate":1435608519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283746\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283746-shelbylayne4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">shelbylayne4<\/span><\/a> and welcome to BDW! Oh my goodness - you have to talk tho the administrators of this site Wright Travel! They are destination wedding experts and the host is a Dreams Cabo bride herself!! Cabo has some beautiful hotels so I know they wouldbe able to help iOS out with what you want and what you don't want, along with your budget and price point for your guests. You can contact them though this site - just look for the link. We've looked at the Riu Santa Fe, plus as I said Tammy is a Dreams Cabo bride. There are a lot of west coast brides here that get married in the Cabo area. You could also look at the resort review tab on this site and see what past brides have had to say about their experience.<br><br>\nGood luck and happy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79329","Title":"Wedding In Cabo San Lucas- Need Hotel Help!","LastPostDate":1435608519},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
