t;Has anyone been recently married at the Gran Bahia Principe Esmeralda in Punta Cana or getting married there soon. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;I have booked there for May 2013 and was wondering if anyone can give me any recommendations?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1626187,"PostDate":1338482419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Has anyone been recently married at the Gran Bahia Principe Esmeralda in Punta Cana or getting married there soon. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I have booked there for May 2013 and was wondering if anyone can give me any recommendations?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"saraworld@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334868539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254253.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sosodj","Id":254253,"Name":"sosodj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0