"IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69f18973b8b1152611f2197ffa690009","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Are you doing a private reception or in a restaurant?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1639131,"PostDate":1341698683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Are you doing a private reception or in a restaurant?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"saraworld@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334868539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254253.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sosodj","Id":254253,"Name":"sosodj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bffc8a059acff8edcb36094359a182e","RawContent":"I think it will have to be private because I expect more than 30 guests. You?","Attachments":[],"Id":1639363,"PostDate":1341782349,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think it will have to be private because I expect more than 30 guests. You?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erin_d17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338005249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255848.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"erin4070","Id":255848,"Name":"erin4070","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c69f81c4e3b751297422e1f984eecaf","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sosodj[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Are you doing a private reception or in a restaurant?\n[\/quote] \n yes I&#039;m having a private one, I&#039;m not sure how many people we will be but 30 have already confirmed. Many of my guests are coming from all over  so i would like to catch up with all of them. I&#039;m renting a terrace as i think that this was the most economical for me because i have a feeling that we will be as much as 50 people. \n \n Have you decided on anything else? what were you thinking about doing for decorations?","Attachments":[],"Id":1639536,"PostDate":1341842365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sosodj<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Are you doing a private reception or in a restaurant?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> yes I'm having a private one, I'm not sure how many people we will be but 30 have already confirmed. Many of my guests are coming from all over\u00a0 so i would like to catch up with\u00a0all of them. I'm renting a terrace as i think that this was the most economical for me because i have a feeling that we will be as much as 50 people.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have you decided on anything else? what\u00a0were you thinking about doing for decorations?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"saraworld@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334868539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254253.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sosodj","Id":254253,"Name":"sosodj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dadc4db2b9379d56c3f89c625abc5ba2","RawContent":"I think we are doing the terrace too, I like the open air concept. I haven&#039;t decided on decorations though yet. Are you doing an open bar? I would really like to know where the closest bar is in relation to the terrace. I have a hard time paying $40\/person for 3 hours of bar service at an all inclusive! I also think I&#039;m going with the set menu from the garden grill- its easiest due to allergies within the family.","Attachments":[],"Id":1639938,"PostDate":1341932382,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think we are doing the terrace too, I like the open air concept. I haven't decided on decorations though yet. Are you doing an open bar? I would really like to know where the closest bar is in relation to the terrace. I have a hard time paying $40\/person for 3 hours of bar service at an all inclusive! I also think I'm going with the set menu from the garden grill- its easiest due to allergies within the family.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erin_d17@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338005249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255848.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"erin4070","Id":255848,"Name":"erin4070","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a00f2528354576c663be2c0595c7a651","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]erin4070[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I think we are doing the terrace too, I like the open air concept. I haven&#039;t decided on decorations though yet. Are you doing an open bar? I would really like to know where the closest bar is in relation to the terrace. I have a hard time paying $40\/person for 3 hours of bar service at an all inclusive! I also think I&#039;m going with the set menu from the garden grill- its easiest due to allergies within the family.[\/quote] \n i am doing an open bar and i know exactly what you mean, i&#039;ve been trying to reach out to people who have been there before so that they can direct me as where the bars are located and where is the best place to hold a welcome cocktail when everyone arrived but so far i haven&#039;t got any responses yet","Attachments":[],"Id":1639963,"PostDate":1341936225,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>erin4070<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I think we are doing the terrace too, I like the open air concept. I haven't decided on decorations though yet. Are you doing an open bar? I would really like to know where the closest bar is in relation to the terrace. I have a hard time paying $40\/person for 3 hours of bar service at an all inclusive! I also think I'm going with the set menu from the garden grill- its easiest due to allergies within the family.<\/blockquote> <p> i am doing an open bar and i know exactly what you mean, i've been trying to reach out to people who have been there before so that they can direct me as where the bars are located and where is the best place to hold a welcome cocktail when everyone arrived but so far i haven't got any\u00a0responses yet\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"saraworld@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334868539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254253.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sosodj","Id":254253,"Name":"sosodj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f4c3f3ce7ea16fa3a4ed79f61915a87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am also haing my reception at the Garden Grill.&amp;nbsp; I was able to find where it&#039;s located.&amp;nbsp; It is on the Punta Cana part of the resort and number 14 on this map.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;12652&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Bahia_Principe_Bavaro_Punta_Cana_map.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;95&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":23758,"Name":"Bahia_Principe_Bavaro_Punta_Cana_map.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2012\/post-55675-138622413945.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2012\/post-55675-138622413945_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":530}],"Id":1657912,"PostDate":1346254837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am also haing my reception at the Garden Grill.\u00a0 I was able to find where it's located.\u00a0 It is on the Punta Cana part of the resort and number 14 on this map.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"12652\",\"name\":\"Bahia_Principe_Bavaro_Punta_Cana_map.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"95\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristiehuys@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1335465655,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254564.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kch727","Id":254564,"Name":"kch727","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"67845","Title":"Gran Bahia Principe Esmeralda in Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1422378439},"Pages":{"TotalItems":30,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
