 \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> the inside<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"160657\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/160657\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; cursor: default; \" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> inside as they started to set up a wedding, there was the head table at back and 7 round tables... (the chairs get covered in white)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"160660\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/160660\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; cursor: default; \" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> the bbq a la carte (the one that sits up to 120 i believe, buffet style, share with other guests or 3000$ private) papayas are lower and not attached so rain can be an issue!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"160651\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/160651\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> the inside air conditionned one, up to 40 guests (i think 1000$ unsure as we have too many guest for this one) there is 2, the lady said they look the same...<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"160652\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/160652\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"160653\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/160653\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> one half on the disco, there is a bar on top and another on the other side<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"160655\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/160655\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have more of vegetation, pool, beach, jacuzzi area etc if you need, let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"claudine1@sympatico.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338513496,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256108.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"claudinemercier","Id":256108,"Name":"claudinemercier","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a478760263e04bdc9ec84fd48780884","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; lol i just figured it out!!! in the box where you type, there is a series of icons on top, 8th one from left lets you upload!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; for some reason though i put 20, and its not here now ;( wonder what i did wrong!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you have facebook, add me to your contacts, you will see the whole album ;) (claudine1@sympatico.ca)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1658806,"PostDate":1346434246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> lol i just figured it out!!! in the box where you type, there is a series of icons on top, 8th one from left lets you upload!<\/p> <p> for some reason though i put 20, and its not here now ;( wonder what i did wrong!<\/p> <p> If you have facebook, add me to your contacts, you will see the whole album <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> (claudine1@sympatico.ca)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"claudine1@sympatico.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338513496,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256108.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"claudinemercier","Id":256108,"Name":"claudinemercier","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67845,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90e015357ece7c24416ec1c7c0fe9e60","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; test... gazebo&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt